posts.body:
@alice_gristle
Nothing set in stone yet, and I am still awaiting the day Miss Gristle shows up, so perhaps I will never adjust my schedule for as long as you don't come
@thenerdmansion
you're a masochist, but glad you enjoyed it
On the one hand, I appreciate your relentless positivity (it's certainly better than some developer's games I have reviewed in the past), but I hope you are also using all of the reviews you have received recently: Mine, WooTBM, and Alice's reviews to help you improve your games. You're definitely a game making machine, with more games under your belt than most of us, so I hope these reviews are helping you cook up something great that will knock us off our feet.

I briefly peaked at your past games before, but never actually downloaded anything. I'll have to give it another look through.
you gotta to clarify one thing for me though;
Is this farmer PvP? Because...I really like this idea. And if so, you're a genre genius.

Iunno, I usually start going downhill right away. Less effort.
@TheAM-Dol
good stream (as always). Was crazy that so many people showed up!

@TheAM-Dol
Product of deciding to start with a week to go. I'm considering redoing it as a more polished experience now that the jam is over. If I do, there's a chance it'll shift to a courtroom experience instead. Not sure.
I'm just personally impressed I finished anything in such short time, especially something that isn't (at least shouldn't be) straight broken.

@Willibab
I think my main take away is...
you did not dodge the bullet.
